WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.469
The sun was warm.

2
00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.587
Cat was sleeping on the well.

3
00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:15.735
Beep! Beep!

4
00:00:15.736 --> 00:00:18.956
A car went by.

5
00:00:18.957 --> 00:00:24.536
Its horn was very loud.

6
00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:26.851
Cat woke up.

7
00:00:26.852 --> 00:00:28.721
Then Cat fell.

8
00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:31.759
She fell into the well!

9
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.423
"Oh no!" cried Dog.

10
00:00:35.424 --> 00:00:39.954
"Help! Help!" called Cat.

11
00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:43.360
"Do not worry, Cat," said Dog.

12
00:00:43.361 --> 00:00:45.918
"We will help you!"

13
00:00:45.919 --> 00:00:53.850
Dog ran to Cow.

14
00:00:53.851 --> 00:00:57.733
"Cat fell in the well!" he said.

15
00:00:57.734 --> 00:01:02.004
"We must get her out."

16
00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:05.971
They ran to Pig's pen.

17
00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:09.626
"Cat fell in the well," said Dog.

18
00:01:09.627 --> 00:01:13.458
"We must get her out!"

19
00:01:13.459 --> 00:01:17.223
"Help!" cried Cat.

20
00:01:17.224 --> 00:01:20.618
"Please help me!"

21
00:01:20.619 --> 00:01:24.974
Poor Cat!

22
00:01:24.975 --> 00:01:31.421
The well was not wet.

23
00:01:31.422 --> 00:01:35.309
But the well was deep.

24
00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:40.987
And it was very dark.

